ARG E2 Balance is derived from VM-UNet by Jiacheng Ruan and Suncheng Xiang.
Upstream repository: https://github.com/JCruan519/VM-UNet
Upstream commit: b87827eb5a5faff00bd4b7b6505e56d3ca813ca2
Upstream license: Apache License, Version 2.0 (see LICENSE).

The ARG E2 Balance version modifies these upstream files:
  models/vmunet/vmamba.py: adds ARG feedback to the SS2D B/C inputs.
  models/vmunet/vmunet.py: adds ARG attachment and auxiliary training output.
  train_synapse.py: adds the E2 protocol, online augmentation and run audit.
  engine_synapse.py: adds ARG training supervision and per-case evaluation.
  configs/config_setting_synapse.py: sets num_workers to 32 for E2.

utils.py and datasets/dataset.py retain the upstream source bytes.
The reference/ directory contains upstream code used by the self-checks.
